4,Austronesian Music - Music genre - Rate Your Music,https://rateyourmusic.com/genre/austronesian-music/,"Using a zither in the form of a bamboo pipe rounded by strings, called sasando/sasandu/valiha/kolibit as an accompaniment of narrative songs; also other corresponding traditions using different instruments (Sundanese pantun, dayak sape).Austronesian music nowadays refers to the ongoing evolution ...",Lau,Austronesian
5,Austronesian Music - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCGAXcH95xpp9X5z3iZDZl6Q,"Hi everyone! Welcome to Austronesian Music🎶This channel mainly posts music from Austronesian countries and languages, and also other songs of languages of Southeast Asia. Hope you all enjoy🤗LIKE & SUBSCRIBE + PROMOTE",Lau,Austronesian
6,Austronesian Soundscapes: Performing Arts in Oceania and Southeast Asia | IIAS,https://www.iias.asia/books/austronesian-soundscapes-performing-arts-oceania-and-southeast-asia,"Ramon P. Santos, Ph.D. UP Center for Ethnomusicology ""The island world of the Pacific and Indian oceans, inhabited by peoples speaking Austronesian languages, has an extremely variegated cultural spectrum. This volume is organised as a musical view on the historical map of the Austronesian expansion, attempting for the first time to see how the performing arts contribute to understanding the interlinkages of this immense cultural area and thus providing a fresh and welcome view on these understudied, yet extremely diverse musical cultures.""",Lau,Austronesian
